						<r3d:remarks>ECN is the UK member of the International Long-Term Ecological Research Network (ILTER) and of LTER-Europe. ECN is a multi-agency programme sponsored by a consortium of UK government departments and agencies (https://ecn.ac.uk/what-we-do/about/consortium).  These organisations contribute to the programme through funding either site monitoring and/or network co-ordination activities. ECN data is hosted by UKCEH on behalf of the UK research community: https://eidc.ac.uk/</r3d:remarks>
